  "description": "Baek Yu-Jun seems to have it all: wealth, status, and even good looks. Unfortunately, the one thing he truly desires but can’t have is a boyfriend. Having grown up under a strict grandfather, Yu-Jun was never allowed to honestly express his interests, and this included his sexuality. Even as an adult free from his rigid household, Yu-Jun only gets his romantic fix through television dramas. But soon, he’s thrown into a dramatic love affair of his own upon meeting Han Hui-Won. Things aren’t exactly sunshine and rainbows off the bat though. Not only does Yu-Jun make all the wrong moves to win his crush’s heart, but Hui-Won has met all the wrong guys and is now sick of dating altogether. Will these two be able to overcome their shaky start and achieve their happily ever after?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
